00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:44.236
- This is enormous.

00:00:44.236 --> 00:00:45.426
Is this for one person?

00:00:45.426 --> 00:00:46.783
- This is, like, family size.

00:00:46.783 --> 00:00:50.533
This is an Oreo cookie
palette, like a plate.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.228
- That's some good ass chocolate.

00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:56.061
- Mmm.

00:00:56.061 --> 00:00:56.894
- Mmm.

00:00:56.894 --> 00:00:57.727
- Mmm.

00:00:57.727 --> 00:00:58.560
- Mmm.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.393
- M-Hm.

00:01:01.557 --> 00:01:03.679
- Where are you taking that?

00:01:03.679 --> 00:01:04.555
- I figured you were done.

00:01:04.555 --> 00:01:05.388
- This tastes like

00:01:05.388 --> 00:01:06.221
- Sh, just have a minute.

00:01:06.221 --> 00:01:07.718
- Okay, yeah, we'll just
have a sec to enjoy.

00:01:07.718 --> 00:01:10.298
- It's creamy, you got
the crunch in the middle.

00:01:10.298 --> 00:01:11.806
- It's like a really
soft, milky chocolate.

00:01:11.806 --> 00:01:15.203
- The first bite I took
actually hurt a tooth back here.

00:01:15.203 --> 00:01:17.346
- Why don't they sell Oreo cream in jars?

00:01:17.346 --> 00:01:18.615
- Oh, what, no.

00:01:18.615 --> 00:01:21.016
- This is a lot for me, this is very rich.

00:01:21.016 --> 00:01:23.866
- You know the food is good
when you sing a little tune.

00:01:23.866 --> 00:01:25.860
- Or you, like, do a little movement.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:26.693
- Mm-Hm.

00:01:26.693 --> 00:01:27.943
- That's a lot.

00:01:29.846 --> 00:01:30.929
That's a lot.

00:01:30.929 --> 00:01:31.961
- It's not.

00:01:31.961 --> 00:01:34.473
- Get this in a stocking.

00:01:34.473 --> 00:01:35.890
- Seven servings?

00:01:36.924 --> 00:01:39.319
Please, what, for ants?

00:01:39.319 --> 00:01:43.058
- This exceeded my expectations by 110%.

00:01:43.058 --> 00:01:44.587
- Oreo, you done good.

00:01:44.587 --> 00:01:46.598
- [Woman In Hat] I liked
to dip cookies in tea.

00:01:46.598 --> 00:01:49.431
